{
  "file_id": "3580",
  "text_count": 83,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "��������Nf... U-Ugh...",
      "_offset": 3618,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "Where am...?",
      "_offset": 3641,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "Oh, you're awake?",
      "_offset": 3654,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "Hikari!",
      "_offset": 3672,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "Takeru... Tailmon...",
      "_offset": 3680,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "How do you feel?",
      "_offset": 3701,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "My fever's coming down. And I feel\na lot better.",
      "_offset": 3718,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "Oh, Hikari! You're awake.",
      "_offset": 3767,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "Sora...?",
      "_offset": 3793,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "Where's Taichi?",
      "_offset": 3802,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "I couldn't find him anywhere\nnearby, but I've found this: cold\nmedicine!",
      "_offset": 3818,
      "_length": 72,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "Pretty sure Taichi must have\ngotten it for you and dropped it.",
      "_offset": 3891,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "Medicine that Taichi had... so\ndoes that mean he's somewhere\naround here?",
      "_offset": 3954,
      "_length": 73,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "Seems like this place is a maze.\nIf we look for him together, I'm\nsure we'll find him.",
      "_offset": 4028,
      "_length": 86,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "You see? So cheer up!",
      "_offset": 4115,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "I'll help you guys out! I'm his\nlittle sister, after all!",
      "_offset": 4137,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "Wait!",
      "_offset": 4195,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "What's wrong, Sora?",
      "_offset": 4201,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "Quiet! I can hear voices coming\nfrom there!",
      "_offset": 4221,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "Let's get a little closer.",
      "_offset": 4265,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "Work! Work! Work harder!",
      "_offset": 4292,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "Nuuuu!",
      "_offset": 4317,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "Listen up, Numemon. This here\nmountain's the property of\nMugendramon.",
      "_offset": 4324,
      "_length": 69,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "And you all are the power source\nfor the greater urban area! So\nwork, work, work until you die!",
      "_offset": 4394,
      "_length": 95,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "Nuuuu!!",
      "_offset": 4490,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Is that... Monzaemon?",
      "_offset": 4498,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "That's not Monzaemon. It's\nWaruMonzaemon!",
      "_offset": 4520,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "The poor Numemon...",
      "_offset": 4562,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "Hikari...?!",
      "_offset": 4582,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "Nuuuu!?",
      "_offset": 4597,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "What's going on? Flaking off now?",
      "_offset": 4605,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "Y...You!!",
      "_offset": 4639,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "Gyaaaaah! Run!!",
      "_offset": 4649,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "Hey! Stop right there!",
      "_offset": 4665,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "Tailmon, don't worry about me. We\nhave to free the Numemon.",
      "_offset": 4688,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "All right...",
      "_offset": 4748,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "Stop!",
      "_offset": 4761,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "What are we gonna do, Sora?",
      "_offset": 4767,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "The only thing we can do is run!",
      "_offset": 4795,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "Lady Hikari... Lady Hikari...",
      "_offset": 4828,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "The Numemon are...",
      "_offset": 4858,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "Gyaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 4881,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "Aaaaah!",
      "_offset": 4891,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "Hikari?",
      "_offset": 4903,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "Nu, nuuuuuu!",
      "_offset": 4911,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "Hey, you Numemon over there!\nWhaddya think you're doing?",
      "_offset": 4924,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "Nu!",
      "_offset": 4981,
      "_length": 3,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "...Gh! Who released the Numemon?",
      "_offset": 4985,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "That would be me.",
      "_offset": 5018,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "Hikari!",
      "_offset": 5036,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "Hikari!",
      "_offset": 5044,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "Why, you!",
      "_offset": 5052,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "Nuuuu!",
      "_offset": 5062,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "You think you can defeat *me*, the\ngreat WaruMonzaemon?",
      "_offset": 5069,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "Nu, nu!",
      "_offset": 5125,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "Hah hah ha! It's the end for you!",
      "_offset": 5133,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "W-What's with this light...",
      "_offset": 5167,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "Hikari...",
      "_offset": 5195,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "I feel power coming from inside\nher...",
      "_offset": 5205,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "Yeah, there's power overflowing\nfrom inside her body!",
      "_offset": 5244,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "Wanna try going at it?",
      "_offset": 5298,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "Yeah! Leave it to us!",
      "_offset": 5321,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "I'm ready whenever you are!",
      "_offset": 5343,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "Gaaahh!!",
      "_offset": 5371,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "Are you okay, Numemon?",
      "_offset": 5380,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "Nu... nu...",
      "_offset": 5403,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "They'll be okay in no time flat!",
      "_offset": 5415,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "Thank goodness...",
      "_offset": 5448,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "Hikari's light...",
      "_offset": 5466,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "The light is showing us the way...",
      "_offset": 5484,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "If we keep following the light,\nmaybe we'll find Taichi and the\nothers!",
      "_offset": 5519,
      "_length": 71,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "Okay! We'll put our faith in your\nlight, Hikari.",
      "_offset": 5591,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "Sora... I wonder how Yamato is\ndoing?",
      "_offset": 5640,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "Yamato has Gabumon with him.",
      "_offset": 5678,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "He wouldn't want you sad, Takeru.",
      "_offset": 5707,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "Those two won't be taken down so\neasily.",
      "_offset": 5741,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "I'm sure he'll come back when he\nfeels better.",
      "_offset": 5782,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "Yeah...",
      "_offset": 5829,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "I'm sure he's thinking of you,\nTakeru.",
      "_offset": 5837,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "So have faith in him, okay?",
      "_offset": 5876,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "You're right... Yamato's always\nthinking of me.",
      "_offset": 5904,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "But this time, I'll be the one to\nlook after him!",
      "_offset": 5952,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "_offset": 6002,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    }
  ]
}